                <pb facs="0452" n="380" xml:id="pg380"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 6775/619.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Honduranean
                        Minister for Foreign Affairs.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1909-01-02"><hi rendition="#italic">January 2,
                        1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Cordial greetings to your excellency and to the Central American Conference in
                    opening session.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bacon.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
